# Auto-generated by the TanStack Router Vite plugin from src/routes/ on
# every `vite dev` / `vite build` — never hand-edited, so it shouldn't be
# committed. Keeping it tracked meant every PR that added a route file
# left main with a stale route tree that only got silently fixed by
# whoever's local dev server happened to be running at the time.
src/routeTree.gen.ts
